[l_braz_por.arms_factory]
Fábrica militar

[l_braz_por.arms_factory_desc]
Esta construção fornece ao estado indústrias para produção de novos equipamentos militares. Pode ser convertida em uma indústria civil se necessário.

[l_braz_por.arms_factory_plural]
Fábricas militares

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Velocidade de edificação de fábricas militares

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de edificação de fábricas militares.

[l_english.arms_factory]
Military Factory

[l_english.arms_factory_desc]
This building provides the state with industry for production of new military equipment. Can be converted to civilian industry if needed.

[l_english.arms_factory_plural]
Military Factories

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
§YMilitary Factory§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Military Factory construction.

[l_french.arms_factory]
Usine militaire

[l_french.arms_factory_desc]
Ce type de bâtiments permet de produire du matériel militaire dans cet État. Si nécessaire, il peut être transformé en usine civile.

[l_french.arms_factory_plural]
Usines militaires

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Vitesse de constr. des usines militaires 

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction des usines militaires.

[l_german.arms_factory]
Militärfabrik

[l_german.arms_factory_desc]
Dieses Gebäude ermöglicht der Region die Produktion neuer militärischer Ausrüstung. Kann bei Bedarf in eine Zivilfabrik umgewandelt werden.

[l_german.arms_factory_plural]
Militärfabriken

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit (Militärfabriken)

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für Militärfabriken.

[l_japanese.arms_factory]
軍需工場

[l_japanese.arms_factory_desc]
新しい軍装品生産のための工業力を供給する。必要であれば、民需工場へと転換できる。

[l_japanese.arms_factory_plural]
軍需工場

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
§Y軍需工場§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
軍需工場建設速度を補正する。

[l_korean.arms_factory]
군수공장

[l_korean.arms_factory_desc]
이 건물은 해당 주에 신규 군사 장비 생산을 위한 산업을 제공합니다. 필요한 경우 민간공장으로 전환될 수 있습니다.

[l_korean.arms_factory_plural]
군수공장

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
§Y군수공장§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
군수공장 건설 속도 변동치.

[l_polish.arms_factory]
Fabryka wojskowa

[l_polish.arms_factory_desc]
Ta fabryka umożliwia produkcję nowego wyposażenia wojskowego w regionie. Może być przekształcona w fabrykę cywilną.

[l_polish.arms_factory_plural]
Fabryki wojskowe

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Tempo budowy fabryk wojskowych

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Zmiana tempa budowy fabryk wojskowych.

[l_russian.arms_factory]
Военный завод

[l_russian.arms_factory_desc]
Это сооружение снабжает регион новой военной техникой. При необходимости его можно превратить в завод по выпуску мирной продукции.

[l_russian.arms_factory_plural]
Военные заводы

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Скорость строительства §Yвоенных заводов§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства военных заводов.

[l_simp_chinese.arms_factory]
军用工厂

[l_simp_chinese.arms_factory_desc]
此建筑可为所属地区提供生产军事装备的工业能力，或可因需转换为民用工厂。

[l_simp_chinese.arms_factory_plural]
军用工厂

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
§Y军用工厂§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
改变军用工厂建设的建设速度。

[l_spanish.arms_factory]
Fábrica militar

[l_spanish.arms_factory_desc]
Este edificio proporciona al estado la industria para la producción de nuevo equipo militar. Se puede convertir a industria civil si es necesario.

[l_spanish.arms_factory_plural]
Fábricas militares

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de §YFábrica Militar§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_arms_factory_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de fábricas militares.

